    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** `citations[i]` is how many times a researcher's i-th paper has been cited. Their **h-index** is the largest `h` such that they have **at least h papers with at least h citations** each. Return it."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/1fd82536-8f01-49e2-838a-6507bd264c8c.svg",
      "alt": "Citations 3, 0, 6, 1, 5 sorted from most to least cited: 6, 5, 3, 1, 0, drawn as bars. A diagonal marks rank 1, 2, 3 and so on. The first three bars reach at least their rank — 6 at least 1, 5 at least 2, 3 at least 3 — but the fourth, 1, is below 4. So the h-index is 3.",
      "width": 592,
      "height": 419,
